{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an online competitive game where players place on the board the girls of Gensokyo and vie for supremacy in their precious bonds (friendship).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specifically, like in \u201cFive in a Row,\u201d you place character cards as stones in straight lines to increase your overall precious bonds (the points needed to win).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, since the goal is to compete for the friendship, the characters placed next to each other must be friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has unique abilities, such as \u201cplacing multiple stones in one move\u201d or \u201cdestroying the opponent's stones,\u201d among others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In particular, the \u201cSpell Card,\u201d which can be used once per match, is extremely powerful, and its usage can significantly influence the outcome of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like many TCGs (Trading Card Games), you can freely select cards from your collection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to build your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To achieve overall precious bonds, it's essential that adjacent cards work well together,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so deck construction requires more conscious synergy than other TCGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606This game is a fan-made game based on the Touhou Project.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3792490?t=1772958903","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3792490?t=1772958903","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792490/55864c51cda0b75f1dd2533d844b860acd105a48/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772958903","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792490/55864c51cda0b75f1dd2533d844b860acd105a48/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772958903","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an online competitive game where players place on the board the girls of Gensokyo and vie for supremacy in their precious bonds (friendship).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specifically, like in \u201cFive in a Row,\u201d you place character cards as stones in straight lines to increase your overall precious bonds (the points needed to win).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, since the goal is to compete for the friendship, the characters placed next to each other must be friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has unique abilities, such as \u201cplacing multiple stones in one move\u201d or \u201cdestroying the opponent's stones,\u201d among others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In particular, the \u201cSpell Card,\u201d which can be used once per match, is extremely powerful, and its usage can significantly influence the outcome of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like many TCGs (Trading Card Games), you can freely select cards from your collection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to build your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To achieve overall precious bonds, it's essential that adjacent cards work well together,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so deck construction requires more conscious synergy than other TCGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2606This game is a fan-made game based on the Touhou Project.</p>","developers":["\u7dd1\u9752\u5de5\u623f"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792490/634f3dfd677c31903131748091ffefae31e9897c/header.jpg?t=1772958903","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3792490/1229565131/f54f6ea85543098626e2c2246298c05ff93eba15/1750369284/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749883927","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3792490/1229565131/f54f6ea85543098626e2c2246298c05ff93eba15/1750369284/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749883927","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3792490/1229565131/f54f6ea85543098626e2c2246298c05ff93eba15/1750369284/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749883927","id":257155965,"name":"PV1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155965/c56e2d44ed94666de6b27396ddea621ff9990e80/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749883927"}],"name":"\u6771\u65b9\u9023\u73e0","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-8250U CPU@ 1.60GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel(R) UHD Graphics 620<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-8250U CPU@ 1.60GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel(R) UHD Graphics 620<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":fal